s (OpenCL, SYCL, Vulkan Compute).\n  - When you want maximum throughput for memory-bound or balanced workloads.\n  - Default behavior for most applications.\n\n#### **`ccs_mode 2` (High-Latency Hiding / Throughput Mode)**\n- **Behavior**: This mode often prioritizes **latency hiding"}